Hi,

Please find in attached file the details of hardware ( lspci -vvv) command.
I have noticed one difference between kernel versions 4.4.27 and 4.14.20:
For  4.14.20, I get with ethtool eth1 :
Settings for eth1:
    Supported ports: [ FIBRE ]
